== Effects ==
* Upon use, Isaac farts and [[knock-back|knocks back]] nearby enemies.
** {{dlc|a}} Projectiles are also deflected.
*** {{dlc|r}} Enemies pushed into walls or [[obstacle]]s take <code>10 + 2 * (floor - 1)</code> damage.
*** {{dlc|r}} The deflected projectiles deal 6 damage if they would've hurt Isaac for half a heart, and 7 for a full heart.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|a+nr}} If Isaac swaps Butter Bean for a different active item, then picks up Butter Bean again, it has a 10% chance to transform into {{i|Wait What?|n}}.
* {{dlc|r}} When a run is started, the game has a 5% chance to replace Butter Bean with {{i|Wait What?|n}} in item pools. Both items are generally not available in the same run.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Bird's Eye}}/{{i|Ghost Pepper}}: Shoots a flame behind Isaac upon each use of Butter Bean. Two flames will be shot if Isaac also has {{I|Car Battery|n}}.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns white wisps on the inner ring. The wisps do not shoot tears, have only 1 health each, release farts that knockback upon death, and cannot be carried across rooms.}}
* {{t|Panic Button}}: Activates Butter Bean upon taking damage. If the damage was from a projectile that Butter Bean can knock away, it will be negated.

